# Essential Commands

Task: The file `{{work_dir}}/{{data_file}}` contains measurement samples, one per line, in the form `category value` (a category name, one space, an integer value).

Generate the aggregated report `{{work_dir}}/{{report_file}}` with one line per category, in the form:

```
category total average
```

where `total` is the sum of all values of that category (as an integer) and `average` is their arithmetic mean formatted with exactly two decimal places. Fields are separated by a single space. The lines must be sorted alphabetically by category name.

Do not modify `{{data_file}}`.
